2.Describe the complete pipeline of sentiment analysis using RNN.

Step 1 - Collect the Data
Eg Food was good --> Positive 
   Food was bas  --> Negative

Step 2 - Convert  to lowecase, remove unwanted symbols
eg "Food was good !!"
becomes "food was good"

Step 3 - Tokkenization 
Split text into words
food was good
["food","was","good"]

Step 4 - Create Vocabulary
food -> 1
was  -> 2
good -> 3
bad  -> 4

Step 5 - Convert words to intergers
food was good --> [1,2,3]

Step 6 - Padding 
Make all sequences equal length 
[1,2,3] -> [0,1,2,3]

Step 7 - Embedding Layer
Convert IDs into dense vectors
1->[0.2,0.7,-0.1]
2->[0.3,0.1,0.8]
3->[0.5,-0.2,0.4]

Step 8 - RNN Processing
RNN reads one word at a time and updates hidden state1`

